# Public brand values for production builds.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables are inlined into the browser bundle at BUILD time,
# so they must be present when `next build` runs, not only at runtime. Without
# them the white-label defaults in src/lib/brand.ts apply and the site ships
# branded "Bullza". None of these are secrets, so they live in the repo.
#
# Deployment-specific values (the gateway address, the websocket URL) are NOT
# here on purpose — set those per environment, e.g. in the Vercel dashboard:
#   GATEWAY_INTERNAL_URL=https://api.your-domain.com
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=wss://api.your-domain.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME=KALKS
NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_SLUG=kalks
NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_DOMAIN=kalks.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_SUPPORT_EMAIL=support@kalks.com
